(3495161, 489295, 75651, '<td valign="top">I really, really would have liked a faster shutter speaad to be able to identify the numbers, or even the seperation of color between red, black and green.  However, that''s me and might not be the same for everyone.  I like the fact that the ball is stationary though.  Very nice.</td>', 'I really, really would have liked a faster shutter speaad to be able to identify the numbers, or even the seperation of color between red, black and green.  However, that''s me and might not be the same for everyone.  I like the fact that the ball is stationary though.  Very nice.', '2007-03-28 19:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3495165, 488345, 75651, '<td valign="top">The photo was definitely taken with tungsten lighting.  If you don''t have the proper lighting, use the daylight to make it more nature.  And not to turn the knife, but the focus definitely needs some tending to.</td>', 'The photo was definitely taken with tungsten lighting.  If you don''t have the proper lighting, use the daylight to make it more nature.  And not to turn the knife, but the focus definitely needs some tending to.', '2007-03-28 19:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
