(3495201, 487285, 73412, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea.  I thought of doing something similar but didn''t.  Nice composition. Id like to see less grain in the soup for better image quality, but maybe you were going for this effect. You are the artist so it''s hard sometimes to produce constructive criticism when maybe what you are criticizing is exactly what the artist intended to do.</td>', 'This is a cool idea.  I thought of doing something similar but didn''t.  Nice composition. Id like to see less grain in the soup for better image quality, but maybe you were going for this effect. You are the artist so it''s hard sometimes to produce constructive criticism when maybe what you are criticizing is exactly what the artist intended to do.', '2007-03-28 20:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
