(3498532, 488848, 66524, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  It will be a long time before I know how these set ups are done.  I love the center.  The white rim and black background seem to compete altogether with the photo - it''s like there are 3 things to look at: center, white and black.  Given the center is so awesome - 8</td>', 'Very creative.  It will be a long time before I know how these set ups are done.  I love the center.  The white rim and black background seem to compete altogether with the photo - it''s like there are 3 things to look at: center, white and black.  Given the center is so awesome - 8', '2007-03-29 23:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498534, 487816, 51747, '<td valign="top">I love helicopter pix. It''s almost impossible to stop their rotors completely!</td>', 'I love helicopter pix. It''s almost impossible to stop their rotors completely!', '2007-03-29 23:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498538, 487413, 51747, '<td valign="top">I like the Sepia tones. This could have been taken 100 years ago.</td>', 'I like the Sepia tones. This could have been taken 100 years ago.', '2007-03-29 23:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498539, 488426, 51747, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness and the lighting!</td>', 'I like the sharpness and the lighting!', '2007-03-29 23:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
