(3498545, 489583, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but it doesn''t show ''spinning'' even though the snowboarder may be rotating.</td>', 'Nice capture but it doesn''t show ''spinning'' even though the snowboarder may be rotating.', '2007-03-29 23:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498551, 489591, 66524, '<td valign="top">The flower, the vase, the background and table seem disconnected - which renders it cartoonish (? for lack of a better word).  The photo seems more surreal given the floating nature of the flower, the shadow of the vase vs the lighting on the flower.  Still a creative idea.  I hope you do well.  --- 5</td>', 'The flower, the vase, the background and table seem disconnected - which renders it cartoonish (? for lack of a better word).  The photo seems more surreal given the floating nature of the flower, the shadow of the vase vs the lighting on the flower.  Still a creative idea.  I hope you do well.  --- 5', '2007-03-29 23:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498555, 488103, 72833, '<td valign="top">wow. this is amazing. i love the composition. contrast is great! good job!</td>', 'wow. this is amazing. i love the composition. contrast is great! good job!', '2007-03-29 23:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498561, 489475, 72833, '<td valign="top">interesting angle. same idea as others, but i like how this one stands out. good job.</td>', 'interesting angle. same idea as others, but i like how this one stands out. good job.', '2007-03-29 23:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498563, 489408, 72833, '<td valign="top">sweet! i don''t know how you did this but it is cool! great job. i love all the lights in the city.</td>', 'sweet! i don''t know how you did this but it is cool! great job. i love all the lights in the city.', '2007-03-29 23:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498567, 487751, 66524, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully creative!  I know the feeling, having played the spinning game. I wish there was more to suggest the struggle for balance (a blurred limb?).  Given she is looking at the camera, she has presence of mind to maintain balance after spinning.  I think there is too much background too.  I still love the idea!  --- 6</td>', 'Wonderfully creative!  I know the feeling, having played the spinning game. I wish there was more to suggest the struggle for balance (a blurred limb?).  Given she is looking at the camera, she has presence of mind to maintain balance after spinning.  I think there is too much background too.  I still love the idea!  --- 6', '2007-03-29 23:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498571, 487593, 72833, '<td valign="top">wow this is scary. now that''s a spider! good clarity and nice close up. the position of the spider is cool too.</td>', 'wow this is scary. now that''s a spider! good clarity and nice close up. the position of the spider is cool too.', '2007-03-29 23:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498573, 487987, 72833, '<td valign="top">neat shot. love the reflection, lights, angle, composition.. everything. great job.</td>', 'neat shot. love the reflection, lights, angle, composition.. everything. great job.', '2007-03-29 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498577, 488801, 66524, '<td valign="top">The background is excellent.  If the girl was <b>not</b> looking at the camera and just enjoyed the ride it would have been brilliant with a real child-like expression of fun.  As is, she seems to peaceful against such an exciting background... 6</td>', 'The background is excellent.  If the girl was not looking at the camera and just enjoyed the ride it would have been brilliant with a real child-like expression of fun.  As is, she seems to peaceful against such an exciting background... 6', '2007-03-30 00:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498586, 489531, 66524, '<td valign="top">Me too!  STOP!  This is excellent and in the true spirit of the challenge. If wishes came true, I would have hoped for more focus on the wonderfully giddy face of the child - saddly I can''t imagine how this would be done...bet then her legs say it ALL! I hope you do well and I will look for this one when the scoring is over... 9</td>', 'Me too!  STOP!  This is excellent and in the true spirit of the challenge. If wishes came true, I would have hoped for more focus on the wonderfully giddy face of the child - saddly I can''t imagine how this would be done...bet then her legs say it ALL! I hope you do well and I will look for this one when the scoring is over... 9', '2007-03-30 00:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498590, 488848, 72833, '<td valign="top">cool. this is fun i really like the colors. composition is great. nice job 10!</td>', 'cool. this is fun i really like the colors. composition is great. nice job 10!', '2007-03-30 00:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498595, 489391, 66524, '<td valign="top">Nice title to image - given the (my right) arm placement, are you taking your own photo?  LOL  I aske because i have friend who can do that like an expert!  ... 9</td>', 'Nice title to image - given the (my right) arm placement, are you taking your own photo?  LOL  I aske because i have friend who can do that like an expert!  ... 9', '2007-03-30 00:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498599, 489160, 66524, '<td valign="top">But there are no skates!  So dramatic you don''t need a <b>real</b> skater in the horrible lighting of a rink...LOL  I love it! ... 10</td>', 'But there are no skates!  So dramatic you don''t need a real skater in the horrible lighting of a rink...LOL  I love it! ... 10', '2007-03-30 00:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498600, 489531, 76265, '<td valign="top">This is terrific. I love the emotion on the girls face. Fantastic photo!</td>', 'This is terrific. I love the emotion on the girls face. Fantastic photo!', '2007-03-30 00:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498607, 489416, 66524, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was that there was no "spinning" but then I looked a bit longer and understood your creative thinking.  The threads beg for "out of the box" thinking to be accepted and yet they continue to be voted down.  I hope you do well in the challenge.  8</td>', 'My first reaction was that there was no "spinning" but then I looked a bit longer and understood your creative thinking.  The threads beg for "out of the box" thinking to be accepted and yet they continue to be voted down.  I hope you do well in the challenge.  8', '2007-03-30 00:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
