(3498991, 489498, 53316, '<td valign="top">Well this might not look as slick as some of the studio shots that ribbon here, but you are to be commended.  You have a distraction-free background - it''s a little bit textured (if it were Advanced editing I''d probably have gaussian blurred a duplicate layer and masked off the object, but not much to do in Basic) but on the whole very good. In addition, you created a neat trick effect that gives that "wow" factor that so many voters look for.  This image is one that compels the viewer to linger just a little bit longer.  Focus could be improved, but lighting is great, and I love your border, as it is not too obvious but compliments the image nicely.</td>', 'Well this might not look as slick as some of the studio shots that ribbon here, but you are to be commended.  You have a distraction-free background - it''s a little bit textured (if it were Advanced editing I''d probably have gaussian blurred a duplicate layer and masked off the object, but not much to do in Basic) but on the whole very good. In addition, you created a neat trick effect that gives that "wow" factor that so many voters look for.  This image is one that compels the viewer to linger just a little bit longer.  Focus could be improved, but lighting is great, and I love your border, as it is not too obvious but compliments the image nicely.', '2007-03-30 03:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
