(3499299, 487487, 66575, '<td valign="top">the dude standing in the background takes this shot down a level, for me, but it''s still awesome.</td>', 'the dude standing in the background takes this shot down a level, for me, but it''s still awesome.', '2007-03-30 09:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499305, 488801, 67671, '<td valign="top">makes me feel dizzy just looking, excelent</td>', 'makes me feel dizzy just looking, excelent', '2007-03-30 10:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499370, 489574, 68256, '<td valign="top">Thats so good, I never would have thought of the owl''s ability to spin his head like that and incorperate it into a challenge!<br/> <br/>As far as the photo itself I would have liked more room for the owl.  It is so close to the edge of the frame that I''m having trouble keeping interest in the photo.  I think I would have liked a tighter crop (maybe shoulder up).  Anyway, thanks for a great interpretation and photo.  8</td>', 'Thats so good, I never would have thought of the owl''s ability to spin his head like that and incorperate it into a challenge! As far as the photo itself I would have liked more room for the owl.  It is so close to the edge of the frame that I''m having trouble keeping interest in the photo.  I think I would have liked a tighter crop (maybe shoulder up).  Anyway, thanks for a great interpretation and photo.  8', '2007-03-30 10:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499380, 489377, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  The little boy in the back is so cute!  I also like the splash of color and the spinning softens them (the colors) so nicely.  I''m sure you are getting tons of "too small" and the votes you are receiving are reflecting that.  I''m not going to do that and will give you a 9.  Don''t be discouraged if you are scoring low, it isn''t because of the photo, only because of the size...(in my humble opinion).</td>', 'I really like this photo.  The little boy in the back is so cute!  I also like the splash of color and the spinning softens them (the colors) so nicely.  I''m sure you are getting tons of "too small" and the votes you are receiving are reflecting that.  I''m not going to do that and will give you a 9.  Don''t be discouraged if you are scoring low, it isn''t because of the photo, only because of the size...(in my humble opinion).', '2007-03-30 10:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499388, 487849, 68256, '<td valign="top">Excellent, riding along with him to acheive background motion blur with sharp subject focus...why didn''t I think of that?  10</td>', 'Excellent, riding along with him to acheive background motion blur with sharp subject focus...why didn''t I think of that?  10', '2007-03-30 10:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499395, 489281, 68256, '<td valign="top">I think this works very well for the challenge.  I kinda wish I could see a little of the rain as it would add some impact for me.  As a gardener I can definitely relate to the joyful spinning "rain dance"!  I would have also given it an extra point if there were more room in front of the person..I realize that would have been a very awkward crop because of the extended right hand...but for some reason the mostly centered composition doesn''t work well for me.  Anyway, I really like it and congratulations on a great photo and interpretation of spinning.  8</td>', 'I think this works very well for the challenge.  I kinda wish I could see a little of the rain as it would add some impact for me.  As a gardener I can definitely relate to the joyful spinning "rain dance"!  I would have also given it an extra point if there were more room in front of the person..I realize that would have been a very awkward crop because of the extended right hand...but for some reason the mostly centered composition doesn''t work well for me.  Anyway, I really like it and congratulations on a great photo and interpretation of spinning.  8', '2007-03-30 10:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499399, 489525, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice contre-jour....<br/> <br/>I wished the trees in the bottom were not there and that the arm of the windmill wasn''t cut off on the right side.  Other than that a wonderful shot.  I love the contrasting rain clouds and open sunny sky background.  8</td>', 'Very nice contre-jour.... I wished the trees in the bottom were not there and that the arm of the windmill wasn''t cut off on the right side.  Other than that a wonderful shot.  I love the contrasting rain clouds and open sunny sky background.  8', '2007-03-30 10:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499404, 488052, 68256, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how many people will get this, but being a fisherman who uses spinners frequently I do.  Haveing said that I really don''t care to much for the shot. I can''t really explain why though.  Sorry.  I give it a 6 because technicals are good.</td>', 'I don''t know how many people will get this, but being a fisherman who uses spinners frequently I do.  Haveing said that I really don''t care to much for the shot. I can''t really explain why though.  Sorry.  I give it a 6 because technicals are good.', '2007-03-30 10:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
