(3501146, 489186, 61961, '<td valign="top">Three photos in this challenge (Whoa, look out; Playground fun; Girls just want to have fun) were all taken the same day with the same camera, right?  Snapshots are fun, but more care might be required for these challenges.  I hope you and your friends had a good time anyway!</td>', 'Three photos in this challenge (Whoa, look out; Playground fun; Girls just want to have fun) were all taken the same day with the same camera, right?  Snapshots are fun, but more care might be required for these challenges.  I hope you and your friends had a good time anyway!', '2007-03-31 00:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501148, 489188, 61961, '<td valign="top">Three photos in this challenge (Whoa, look out; Playground fun; Girls just want to have fun) were all taken the same day with the same camera, right?  Snapshots are fun, but more care might be required for these challenges.  I hope you and your friends had a good time anyway!</td>', 'Three photos in this challenge (Whoa, look out; Playground fun; Girls just want to have fun) were all taken the same day with the same camera, right?  Snapshots are fun, but more care might be required for these challenges.  I hope you and your friends had a good time anyway!', '2007-03-31 00:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501149, 489187, 61961, '<td valign="top">Three photos in this challenge (Whoa, look out; Playground fun; Girls just want to have fun) were all taken the same day with the same camera, right?  Snapshots are fun, but more care might be required for these challenges.  I hope you and your friends had a good time anyway!</td>', 'Three photos in this challenge (Whoa, look out; Playground fun; Girls just want to have fun) were all taken the same day with the same camera, right?  Snapshots are fun, but more care might be required for these challenges.  I hope you and your friends had a good time anyway!', '2007-03-31 00:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501153, 488243, 66524, '<td valign="top">lovely!</td>', 'lovely!', '2007-03-31 00:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501159, 489333, 24363, '<td valign="top">great shot if it were in focus, but the idea and set up i like</td>', 'great shot if it were in focus, but the idea and set up i like', '2007-03-31 00:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501168, 489559, 24363, '<td valign="top">focus</td>', 'focus', '2007-03-31 00:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501197, 488426, 66524, '<td valign="top">ohhh, I really like this.  As an art teacher, I had the same idea - but it occured to late for the entry.  I hope you do well.</td>', 'ohhh, I really like this.  As an art teacher, I had the same idea - but it occured to late for the entry.  I hope you do well.', '2007-03-31 00:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501219, 488858, 61961, '<td valign="top">A low score from me for a couple of reasons.  As far as I can tell there''s not one piece of this that is in focus.  Doesn''t really fit the theme, either (spiral is not necessarily a synonym for spinning).</td>', 'A low score from me for a couple of reasons.  As far as I can tell there''s not one piece of this that is in focus.  Doesn''t really fit the theme, either (spiral is not necessarily a synonym for spinning).', '2007-03-31 00:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501225, 488877, 61961, '<td valign="top">A nice try, but for this kind of shot to work the moving object needs to be in focus.  Sometimes it just takes multiple tries (and the correct speed setting).</td>', 'A nice try, but for this kind of shot to work the moving object needs to be in focus.  Sometimes it just takes multiple tries (and the correct speed setting).', '2007-03-31 00:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501228, 489299, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think either the moving billiard ball or the table should be in focus.</td>', 'I think either the moving billiard ball or the table should be in focus.', '2007-03-31 00:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501246, 488175, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think your choice of record title was clever, but the lighting is poor (the glare on the record is a problem).  Lots of "dead" space, too.  I don''t think this was improved by b&amp;w.</td>', 'I think your choice of record title was clever, but the lighting is poor (the glare on the record is a problem).  Lots of "dead" space, too.  I don''t think this was improved by b&w.', '2007-03-31 00:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501256, 488345, 61961, '<td valign="top">It makes sense that the spinning record is blurry, but the other parts of the turntable are out of focus, too.  The light glare is another problem.</td>', 'It makes sense that the spinning record is blurry, but the other parts of the turntable are out of focus, too.  The light glare is another problem.', '2007-03-31 00:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501262, 489434, 61961, '<td valign="top">A low score from me.  I think some color might have added visual interest.  The only sharp thing in the photo is the lower left corner and mabe the center peg on the front spinner.  The empty space glares in the center and upper right.</td>', 'A low score from me.  I think some color might have added visual interest.  The only sharp thing in the photo is the lower left corner and mabe the center peg on the front spinner.  The empty space glares in the center and upper right.', '2007-03-31 00:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501268, 488044, 61961, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I can''t tell at all what is happening in this photo, and it doesn''t seem like an intentional abstract.</td>', 'Sorry, but I can''t tell at all what is happening in this photo, and it doesn''t seem like an intentional abstract.', '2007-03-31 00:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501272, 487285, 61961, '<td valign="top">The white space really glares in this, and the spinnning beverage looks kind of gross.  The stained cup doesn''t help, little things like the red spot on the handle really stand out when you are attempting such a "clean" photo.</td>', 'The white space really glares in this, and the spinnning beverage looks kind of gross.  The stained cup doesn''t help, little things like the red spot on the handle really stand out when you are attempting such a "clean" photo.', '2007-03-31 00:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501274, 488697, 61961, '<td valign="top">This is a really bizarre photo, more nightmare than dreamland.  Probably not your intention.</td>', 'This is a really bizarre photo, more nightmare than dreamland.  Probably not your intention.', '2007-03-31 00:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501276, 488204, 61961, '<td valign="top">I can take a guess that this is a globe, but since I can''t tell...</td>', 'I can take a guess that this is a globe, but since I can''t tell...', '2007-03-31 00:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501278, 487873, 61961, '<td valign="top">Can''t see the bottle (the photo should stand on it''s own without caption).  Not a very interesting arrangement of objects -- seems like it was done without much thought to composition, sorry.</td>', 'Can''t see the bottle (the photo should stand on it''s own without caption).  Not a very interesting arrangement of objects -- seems like it was done without much thought to composition, sorry.', '2007-03-31 00:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501311, 487764, 66524, '<td valign="top">There''s a slight tilt to the left that seems whimsical - like dancing just for the heck of it - or like watching a child suddenly decide to skip on the sidewalk- like it was a magical time to do so.  Your photo brought me true joy - nothing slick - no tricks.  In fact, if I get a song in my head...those tops would tilt the other way too - just think disco (Tango works too).  This seems to be essence of photography without all the smoke and mirrors that leaves a new comer like me perplexed with "How in the heck is that done?" - 10  many thanks ;)</td>', 'There''s a slight tilt to the left that seems whimsical - like dancing just for the heck of it - or like watching a child suddenly decide to skip on the sidewalk- like it was a magical time to do so.  Your photo brought me true joy - nothing slick - no tricks.  In fact, if I get a song in my head...those tops would tilt the other way too - just think disco (Tango works too).  This seems to be essence of photography without all the smoke and mirrors that leaves a new comer like me perplexed with "How in the heck is that done?" - 10  many thanks ;)', '2007-03-31 01:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501349, 489491, 66524, '<td valign="top">Very good concept - I wish the basketball was more true in color - I''ll assume my monitor reads it badly and that you are, infact, terrific! 9</td>', 'Very good concept - I wish the basketball was more true in color - I''ll assume my monitor reads it badly and that you are, infact, terrific! 9', '2007-03-31 01:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501355, 487990, 66524, '<td valign="top">I like this shot - no trickery...just a "real" sense of spinning.</td>', 'I like this shot - no trickery...just a "real" sense of spinning.', '2007-03-31 01:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501382, 488748, 66524, '<td valign="top">I wish your concept was better executed - keep working on the ideas, you have a creative mind :)</td>', 'I wish your concept was better executed - keep working on the ideas, you have a creative mind :)', '2007-03-31 01:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501396, 489331, 66524, '<td valign="top">The colors here seem muted - maybe the blue squares would have added more contrast in your composition.</td>', 'The colors here seem muted - maybe the blue squares would have added more contrast in your composition.', '2007-03-31 01:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501439, 489567, 66524, '<td valign="top">If there was more contrast from subject to background I might get the sense of the spinning theme.  You might have aimed "Around and Around" to be more  more conceptual?  I am trying to see it...been 8 minutes now...There is a contour line around the head that I find interesting - it does set the head apart from the background.  More interesting is that eyes follow me - like Mona Lisa eyes...interesting! 9</td>', 'If there was more contrast from subject to background I might get the sense of the spinning theme.  You might have aimed "Around and Around" to be more  more conceptual?  I am trying to see it...been 8 minutes now...There is a contour line around the head that I find interesting - it does set the head apart from the background.  More interesting is that eyes follow me - like Mona Lisa eyes...interesting! 9', '2007-03-31 02:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501452, 489594, 66524, '<td valign="top">nice idea - I wish there was more contrast for the spinning top to make it stand out - the wood does not add anything substantial to the photo.  The spinning top is a nice capture though. --- 7</td>', 'nice idea - I wish there was more contrast for the spinning top to make it stand out - the wood does not add anything substantial to the photo.  The spinning top is a nice capture though. --- 7', '2007-03-31 02:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501458, 488858, 66524, '<td valign="top">What a cool idea!  Nothing really seems in focus though - I need to work on that too... lol.  keep trying - it gets better with every challenge entry...5</td>', 'What a cool idea!  Nothing really seems in focus though - I need to work on that too... lol.  keep trying - it gets better with every challenge entry...5', '2007-03-31 02:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3501491, 487987, 66524, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the puddle is nice but the pavement that separates it from the wall is distracting (confusing?).  i like the tilt of the photo because it adds to the "spinning" concept...  6</td>', 'The reflection in the puddle is nice but the pavement that separates it from the wall is distracting (confusing?).  i like the tilt of the photo because it adds to the "spinning" concept...  6', '2007-03-31 02:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
