(3502967, 489588, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is cute!  So many shots of people on these playground things.  Nice job on a steady pic while this thing is spinning around.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is cute!  So many shots of people on these playground things.  Nice job on a steady pic while this thing is spinning around.  Good luck!', '2007-03-31 23:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
