(3502974, 489415, 67697, '<td valign="top">A nice and simple picture.  Was it a windy day or did you use something else?  Great composition!</td>', 'A nice and simple picture.  Was it a windy day or did you use something else?  Great composition!', '2007-03-31 23:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
