(3502979, 489579, 66524, '<td valign="top">As with other entries of this genre, I love the concept - very fitting for the challenge.  Your entry could use a better point of view to focus more on the subject matter.  As is, the background does not add to the photo - My eye wanders around the photo.  5</td>', 'As with other entries of this genre, I love the concept - very fitting for the challenge.  Your entry could use a better point of view to focus more on the subject matter.  As is, the background does not add to the photo - My eye wanders around the photo.  5', '2007-03-31 23:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502982, 489559, 66524, '<td valign="top">Great point of view...very original.</td>', 'Great point of view...very original.', '2007-03-31 23:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502991, 489367, 67697, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty idea.  I like the colors and the lighting.  Good luck!</td>', 'That''s a pretty idea.  I like the colors and the lighting.  Good luck!', '2007-03-31 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
