(3502997, 489187, 67697, '<td valign="top">I look forward to searching for your pics (three of you?) in each challenge.  It''s a cute idea.  I wish there was something like this for me and my friends to do while we were in school.  Have fun!</td>', 'I look forward to searching for your pics (three of you?) in each challenge.  It''s a cute idea.  I wish there was something like this for me and my friends to do while we were in school.  Have fun!', '2007-03-31 23:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
