(3506243, 489385, 61961, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to think of this photo.  It is interesting mainly because the fear on the girl''s face is real.  Therefore this seems cruel and exploitative.  Good clarity, considering the spinning.  The sky is a bit washed out, but technical aspects take a backseat to subject matter in this photo, I''d say.  Fits the theme.  Hurts that so many photos in this challenge used the same idea.</td>', 'I don''t know what to think of this photo.  It is interesting mainly because the fear on the girl''s face is real.  Therefore this seems cruel and exploitative.  Good clarity, considering the spinning.  The sky is a bit washed out, but technical aspects take a backseat to subject matter in this photo, I''d say.  Fits the theme.  Hurts that so many photos in this challenge used the same idea.', '2007-04-01 17:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3506244, 488676, 61961, '<td valign="top">This photo reminds me of one of those Dada photos, or like something out of a 30''s movie.  Simple but effective.</td>', 'This photo reminds me of one of those Dada photos, or like something out of a 30''s movie.  Simple but effective.', '2007-04-01 17:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3506403, 488179, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think it''s great that you tried to convey spin in the political sense -- I think you are the only one in the challenge to do that, so points for originality to you.  On the other hand it doesn''t really say "spin" unless you read the caption.  There are a number of technical difficulties, too.  The Bush figure seems out of focus, I guess the other figure is supposed to be Condi, but doesn''t look like her.  She also blends into the background.  Is Bush standing on a leaf?  Is that symbolic?  Let us know!</td>', 'I think it''s great that you tried to convey spin in the political sense -- I think you are the only one in the challenge to do that, so points for originality to you.  On the other hand it doesn''t really say "spin" unless you read the caption.  There are a number of technical difficulties, too.  The Bush figure seems out of focus, I guess the other figure is supposed to be Condi, but doesn''t look like her.  She also blends into the background.  Is Bush standing on a leaf?  Is that symbolic?  Let us know!', '2007-04-01 18:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3506414, 489567, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think this is a poor photo, it''s not apparent that the figure is spinning, and the b&amp;w is dark and without much contrast.  The only plus is the enormous dark eyes of the young man, which would be even more arresting if we could see them properly.</td>', 'I think this is a poor photo, it''s not apparent that the figure is spinning, and the b&w is dark and without much contrast.  The only plus is the enormous dark eyes of the young man, which would be even more arresting if we could see them properly.', '2007-04-01 18:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3506417, 489574, 61961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird.  It doesn''t say "spin" to me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Beautiful bird.  It doesn''t say "spin" to me, I''m afraid.', '2007-04-01 18:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3506425, 489281, 61961, '<td valign="top">This would be much improved if the rain showed (or if the person was visibly wet.  Without the caption I''d never have guessed it was raining.</td>', 'This would be much improved if the rain showed (or if the person was visibly wet.  Without the caption I''d never have guessed it was raining.', '2007-04-01 18:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
