(3506962, 488848, 1031, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a very old cartoon ... a "hillbilly" grandma is found sitting in front of the front-loader by her relatives, with the caption "Well, all I can say is, if this is television you can have it!"</td>', 'Reminds me of a very old cartoon ... a "hillbilly" grandma is found sitting in front of the front-loader by her relatives, with the caption "Well, all I can say is, if this is television you can have it!"', '2007-04-01 19:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3507120, 489591, 35750, '<td valign="top">Wow, this really cought my eye. I had to go back and have a better look. I both like the contrasts, but also the toogle between motion and absolute stillness. ... and the shadow. Good job.</td>', 'Wow, this really cought my eye. I had to go back and have a better look. I both like the contrasts, but also the toogle between motion and absolute stillness. ... and the shadow. Good job.', '2007-04-01 20:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3507156, 488243, 76389, '<td valign="top">Although the idea is interesting the execution of it is lacking. The young girl is striking with her hair flying outward and the red dress to attract the eye but we cannot see the face well enough to relate to her emotions and the contrast is rather flat. Perhaps if you had taken this photograph either in the early morning or toward evening when the lighting would have been softer and warmer. Perhaps allowing her to blurr to suggest motion.</td>', 'Although the idea is interesting the execution of it is lacking. The young girl is striking with her hair flying outward and the red dress to attract the eye but we cannot see the face well enough to relate to her emotions and the contrast is rather flat. Perhaps if you had taken this photograph either in the early morning or toward evening when the lighting would have been softer and warmer. Perhaps allowing her to blurr to suggest motion.', '2007-04-01 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3507157, 489530, 50695, '<td valign="top">My favorite shot of the challenge. Truly ethereal. More watery than a watercolor. 10</td>', 'My favorite shot of the challenge. Truly ethereal. More watery than a watercolor. 10', '2007-04-01 20:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
