(3507519, 489531, 51553, '<td valign="top">Good Job.  I was almost going to do a shot with this in mind.  I don''t have any children or know anyone well enough to ask to borrow their''s, so I neglected to pursue it.  My inspiration was from this image by Gary Friedman.  <br/>//www.friedmanarchives.com/Children/pages/Spinning%20in%20Air.htm<br/>From talking with Gary, I understand it is a very difficult shot to nail.  He had to do about thirty takes, and almost threw-up.</td>', 'Good Job.  I was almost going to do a shot with this in mind.  I don''t have any children or know anyone well enough to ask to borrow their''s, so I neglected to pursue it.  My inspiration was from this image by Gary Friedman.  //www.friedmanarchives.com/Children/pages/Spinning%20in%20Air.htmFrom talking with Gary, I understand it is a very difficult shot to nail.  He had to do about thirty takes, and almost threw-up.', '2007-04-01 22:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
