(3514909, 489071, 32872, '<td valign="top">Thanks...I always wanted to see these lights upclose and since I live in the mountains, there''s a slim chance I''d ever see one up close!  Dang, this image needs to be in the next contest where you shoot against the sun.  It''s always that way. :)</td>', 'Thanks...I always wanted to see these lights upclose and since I live in the mountains, there''s a slim chance I''d ever see one up close!  Dang, this image needs to be in the next contest where you shoot against the sun.  It''s always that way. :)', '2007-04-03 14:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
