(3514913, 488979, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice spin action going on here!</td>', 'Nice spin action going on here!', '2007-04-03 14:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514915, 486997, 26001, '<td valign="top">when i saw thumbnail, i was like..."oh no! a rose???" but then i was positively surprized. nice translucent effect.</td>', 'when i saw thumbnail, i was like..."oh no! a rose???" but then i was positively surprized. nice translucent effect.', '2007-04-03 14:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514916, 489525, 32872, '<td valign="top">Great spin and pretty sky.  Nice image...love windmills.</td>', 'Great spin and pretty sky.  Nice image...love windmills.', '2007-04-03 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514917, 487852, 26001, '<td valign="top">exposure cannot get better than this. good luck!</td>', 'exposure cannot get better than this. good luck!', '2007-04-03 14:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514918, 488852, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The high key effect would have been heightened with a blonde! Sorry, but I don''t think the border helps - good luck</td>', 'Nicely done. The high key effect would have been heightened with a blonde! Sorry, but I don''t think the border helps - good luck', '2007-04-03 14:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514921, 488304, 26001, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful!!! one of my favourites of the challenge.</td>', 'simply beautiful!!! one of my favourites of the challenge.', '2007-04-03 14:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514927, 488487, 32872, '<td valign="top">Cool and creative.  Reminds me of the movie, "Go Ask Alice."  I know this sounds wrong, but the colors need to be more crisp or colorful, imho.</td>', 'Cool and creative.  Reminds me of the movie, "Go Ask Alice."  I know this sounds wrong, but the colors need to be more crisp or colorful, imho.', '2007-04-03 14:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514930, 489461, 25024, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and attempt - good luck</td>', 'Clever idea and attempt - good luck', '2007-04-03 14:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514938, 489048, 32872, '<td valign="top">lol, cute! :)</td>', 'lol, cute! :)', '2007-04-03 15:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514941, 489515, 25024, '<td valign="top">Although I have to admit this shot has little personal appeal you have captured the essence of the spin action well - good luck</td>', 'Although I have to admit this shot has little personal appeal you have captured the essence of the spin action well - good luck', '2007-04-03 15:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514944, 489429, 32872, '<td valign="top">Interesting, beautiful colors for sure and a killer background! pardon the pun.</td>', 'Interesting, beautiful colors for sure and a killer background! pardon the pun.', '2007-04-03 15:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514946, 489306, 25024, '<td valign="top">It''s good but I find the fairy lights in the trees distracting, but I don''t suppose there was much you could do about that was there.</td>', 'It''s good but I find the fairy lights in the trees distracting, but I don''t suppose there was much you could do about that was there.', '2007-04-03 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514950, 489385, 25024, '<td valign="top">I hope the poor girl wasn''t as terrified as she looks! Good composition</td>', 'I hope the poor girl wasn''t as terrified as she looks! Good composition', '2007-04-03 15:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514952, 488103, 32872, '<td valign="top">I really love your idea.  I only wish the wings were larger and higher on his shoulders, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'I really love your idea.  I only wish the wings were larger and higher on his shoulders, but that''s just my opinion.', '2007-04-03 15:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514959, 488099, 25024, '<td valign="top">Cute. I think it may have improved it if they had all been spinning, but the essence is there - good luck</td>', 'Cute. I think it may have improved it if they had all been spinning, but the essence is there - good luck', '2007-04-03 15:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514962, 489583, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good action shot but perhaps more of a spinning emphasis could have been achieved with a slower shutter speed? Good luck</td>', 'Good action shot but perhaps more of a spinning emphasis could have been achieved with a slower shutter speed? Good luck', '2007-04-03 15:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514963, 489567, 32872, '<td valign="top">This is blurry and too dark, but that''s just my silly ole opinion.  This young man has the largest eyes, haunting eyes. You should him in future images as your model. I also like the fact the background is spinning and if the young man were more in focus, your idea would really work.  Hope this helps.</td>', 'This is blurry and too dark, but that''s just my silly ole opinion.  This young man has the largest eyes, haunting eyes. You should him in future images as your model. I also like the fact the background is spinning and if the young man were more in focus, your idea would really work.  Hope this helps.', '2007-04-03 15:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514968, 489533, 25024, '<td valign="top">It''s a good attempt but feels too clutterred with too much going on - good luck</td>', 'It''s a good attempt but feels too clutterred with too much going on - good luck', '2007-04-03 15:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514975, 489071, 25024, '<td valign="top">I think this could have achieved more if you had been able to capture the rotating action but I do like the lens and the way the sunlight is interacting with it. In the right challenge I bet a close up of that would make for a wow image. Good luck</td>', 'I think this could have achieved more if you had been able to capture the rotating action but I do like the lens and the way the sunlight is interacting with it. In the right challenge I bet a close up of that would make for a wow image. Good luck', '2007-04-03 15:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514980, 489434, 25024, '<td valign="top">Well you''ve certainly met the challenge! I wonder if a close up of just the front spinner would have had more impact? Good luck</td>', 'Well you''ve certainly met the challenge! I wonder if a close up of just the front spinner would have had more impact? Good luck', '2007-04-03 15:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514992, 489295, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and challenge criteria well met. For me, I think a faster shutter speed where some definition would have come through could have improved it. Good luck</td>', 'Good lighting and challenge criteria well met. For me, I think a faster shutter speed where some definition would have come through could have improved it. Good luck', '2007-04-03 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515001, 487852, 25024, '<td valign="top">Very effective and good colours, I particularly like the way the background appears through it, good luck</td>', 'Very effective and good colours, I particularly like the way the background appears through it, good luck', '2007-04-03 15:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515010, 489582, 25024, '<td valign="top">Very DNAish. Good colours</td>', 'Very DNAish. Good colours', '2007-04-03 15:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515022, 489185, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the effect but for me, I think the processing has been pushed too far. I do like the surreal effect of it - good luck</td>', 'I like the idea and the effect but for me, I think the processing has been pushed too far. I do like the surreal effect of it - good luck', '2007-04-03 15:24:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3515032, 488778, 25024, '<td valign="top">Probably the best of this type of entry. Good colours and good background blur. I think I would have preferred it if the child had been looking away and looking a little more excited. Hope you do well with it.</td>', 'Probably the best of this type of entry. Good colours and good background blur. I think I would have preferred it if the child had been looking away and looking a little more excited. Hope you do well with it.', '2007-04-03 15:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515035, 488943, 25024, '<td valign="top">I love the abstract nature of this shot with just about enough detail in there to keep you interested. Lovely colours, hope you do well. I am upping this on second looks</td>', 'I love the abstract nature of this shot with just about enough detail in there to keep you interested. Lovely colours, hope you do well. I am upping this on second looks', '2007-04-03 15:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515050, 487737, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and super-duper sky color!  I only wish these beautiful clouds weren''t blown-out.  These windmills are incredibly huge. Nice image.</td>', 'Nice composition and super-duper sky color!  I only wish these beautiful clouds weren''t blown-out.  These windmills are incredibly huge. Nice image.', '2007-04-03 15:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515051, 489415, 25024, '<td valign="top">There''s a good amount of spinning going on. I think if you had less stalk, a closer shoyt with a tighter angle and more interesting cloud you may have got some improvement - good luck</td>', 'There''s a good amount of spinning going on. I think if you had less stalk, a closer shoyt with a tighter angle and more interesting cloud you may have got some improvement - good luck', '2007-04-03 15:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515053, 488323, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice spinage!!</td>', 'Nice spinage!!', '2007-04-03 15:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515059, 488796, 32872, '<td valign="top">Great capture!!  If this young man were more in-focus this image would rock, rock and rock!! Its a great composition.</td>', 'Great capture!!  If this young man were more in-focus this image would rock, rock and rock!! Its a great composition.', '2007-04-03 15:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515064, 489134, 25024, '<td valign="top">It''s a brave attempt but... the faint traces are not helping this, a difficult shot. The lower sky looks good but the foreground is a little too dark and the telegraph pole rather takes over. I hope you don''t mind my attempt at constructive criticism, good luck</td>', 'It''s a brave attempt but... the faint traces are not helping this, a difficult shot. The lower sky looks good but the foreground is a little too dark and the telegraph pole rather takes over. I hope you don''t mind my attempt at constructive criticism, good luck', '2007-04-03 15:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515066, 488713, 32872, '<td valign="top">Oh my, am I missing something here?  It''s hard for me to recognize any Spinning in this image and the colored strip on the bottom is distracting.  Good luck with your photography.</td>', 'Oh my, am I missing something here?  It''s hard for me to recognize any Spinning in this image and the colored strip on the bottom is distracting.  Good luck with your photography.', '2007-04-03 15:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
