(3517343, 489567, 53316, '<td valign="top">Aw this definitely should have scored higher!! Yes, it''s a bit blurry, but motion was what this challenge was all about! I think that for me what the bigger issue is here is the lack of contrast - I''d like for some areas to be whiter.  However, I still gave this a 7 because I do think it''s just a wonderful example of what the challenge called for, and a beautiful image with the oft-mentioned eyes plus the lovely simple-yet-flowing with motion background.</td>', 'Aw this definitely should have scored higher!! Yes, it''s a bit blurry, but motion was what this challenge was all about! I think that for me what the bigger issue is here is the lack of contrast - I''d like for some areas to be whiter.  However, I still gave this a 7 because I do think it''s just a wonderful example of what the challenge called for, and a beautiful image with the oft-mentioned eyes plus the lovely simple-yet-flowing with motion background.', '2007-04-04 03:34:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3517361, 488072, 61348, '<td valign="top">Melethia, I didn''t vote in this challenge. Just saw the picture now. <br/> <br/>I like it verry much but  it''s defenitly not a DPC friendly.<br/> <br/>The only suggestion I have is to remove the white triangle in the left bottom corner. Its the only still element in the picture and attracts the attention. Maybe a square crop?  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Melethia, I didn''t vote in this challenge. Just saw the picture now.  I like it verry much but  it''s defenitly not a DPC friendly. The only suggestion I have is to remove the white triangle in the left bottom corner. Its the only still element in the picture and attracts the attention. Maybe a square crop?   ', '2007-04-04 03:39:49.000000', NULL, 0),
