(3518460, 489068, 72318, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and the rainbow tops it off (i sympathise with you about the dust - i think mine is probably the same) - although i wouldnt recommend a polarising filter for use with a rainbow, arent rainbows by essence polarised light? ND is the way to go :)</td>', 'Nice shot and the rainbow tops it off (i sympathise with you about the dust - i think mine is probably the same) - although i wouldnt recommend a polarising filter for use with a rainbow, arent rainbows by essence polarised light? ND is the way to go :)', '2007-04-04 11:48:38.000000', NULL, 0),
