(3519658, 488852, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hopefully your fiance will get over being camera shy now because this really is a gorgeous picture and she has a wonderful face, wonderful smile, and is quite beautiful in a very natural and not "commercially plastic" way.  I really do like this shot - very well done!</td>', 'Hopefully your fiance will get over being camera shy now because this really is a gorgeous picture and she has a wonderful face, wonderful smile, and is quite beautiful in a very natural and not "commercially plastic" way.  I really do like this shot - very well done!', '2007-04-04 17:23:10.000000', NULL, 0);
