(3521761, 489306, 40386, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue.  This is a beautiful shot.  I used to drive past this (saw it from the time it lay flat for so long because of complications until it was raised) and see it from this angle a few times a week while living in London, the surrounding area sure has changed in the 6 years I have been away.  I thought the "Eye" was only going to be there for a few years, they have obviously changed their minds LOL.  Way to go it was one of my favs in this challenge.<br/></td>', 'Congrats on the Blue.  This is a beautiful shot.  I used to drive past this (saw it from the time it lay flat for so long because of complications until it was raised) and see it from this angle a few times a week while living in London, the surrounding area sure has changed in the 6 years I have been away.  I thought the "Eye" was only going to be there for a few years, they have obviously changed their minds LOL.  Way to go it was one of my favs in this challenge.', '2007-04-05 09:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
