(3524205, 489475, 62318, '<td valign="top">Can''t stress enough, wonderful composition. Unusual perspective really carries this one. A good photographer also takes multiple shots, and that is what I love here.</td>', 'Can''t stress enough, wonderful composition. Unusual perspective really carries this one. A good photographer also takes multiple shots, and that is what I love here.', '2007-04-06 01:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3524214, 488713, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like abstracts and I think the idea is a good one. I think the issue for this one for me is the use of space, with such simple colors without textures, I think there is too much dead space. Maybe putting this into a landscape format (cropping off the bottom) might have pulled it together better? Just a thought. Still I really like what you tried to do. A very different take on the challenge which is always a very good thing. Cheers.</td>', 'I like abstracts and I think the idea is a good one. I think the issue for this one for me is the use of space, with such simple colors without textures, I think there is too much dead space. Maybe putting this into a landscape format (cropping off the bottom) might have pulled it together better? Just a thought. Still I really like what you tried to do. A very different take on the challenge which is always a very good thing. Cheers.', '2007-04-06 01:53:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3524219, 489391, 62318, '<td valign="top">The arm holding the camera always makes a good leading line. :)<br/>A great picture though, I love the different light streaks in the photo. It really creates a sense of depth. <br/> <br/>I can''t believe how young you look, must be some time-reversing carousal.<br/></td>', 'The arm holding the camera always makes a good leading line. :)A great picture though, I love the different light streaks in the photo. It really creates a sense of depth.  I can''t believe how young you look, must be some time-reversing carousal.', '2007-04-06 01:56:43.000000', NULL, 0),
