(3524841, 489441, 66597, '<td valign="top">Christian,<br/>Sorry about the DQ - I know how much it sucks :-(<br/>I have to agree with Jayson that this would be a very different image without the vignetting, though. The spotlight on your son''s face definitely makes the photo "pop".<br/>BTW - did you notice how similar your and Jeffrey''s photos are? It is almost spooky!<br/></td>', 'Christian,Sorry about the DQ - I know how much it sucks :-(I have to agree with Jayson that this would be a very different image without the vignetting, though. The spotlight on your son''s face definitely makes the photo "pop".BTW - did you notice how similar your and Jeffrey''s photos are? It is almost spooky!', '2007-04-06 11:42:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3524880, 489567, 66384, '<td valign="top">Well, you know what -- I like this shot. It conveys that sick dizzy feel you get from spinning. I don''t mind the focus. A little more contrast and a levels adjustment might improve it a bit. Or -- I don''t know how you converted it to b&amp;w, but you might want to take a look at the tutorial on that subject. There is a lot that can be done to adjust the b&amp;w quality when desaturating.</td>', 'Well, you know what -- I like this shot. It conveys that sick dizzy feel you get from spinning. I don''t mind the focus. A little more contrast and a levels adjustment might improve it a bit. Or -- I don''t know how you converted it to b&w, but you might want to take a look at the tutorial on that subject. There is a lot that can be done to adjust the b&w quality when desaturating.', '2007-04-06 11:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
