(3527989, 489567, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6, which is higher than what I gave the blue ribbon. I feel it meets the challenge well. I think the only difference between your shot and mine is that I have more tolerance for spinning (natural dizziness, I believe), so I took more shots until I lucked out on focus. You don''t have to shoot from above like I did because you''re naturally thin and big-eyed. I had to fake it!</td>', 'I gave this a 6, which is higher than what I gave the blue ribbon. I feel it meets the challenge well. I think the only difference between your shot and mine is that I have more tolerance for spinning (natural dizziness, I believe), so I took more shots until I lucked out on focus. You don''t have to shoot from above like I did because you''re naturally thin and big-eyed. I had to fake it!', '2007-04-07 16:38:33.000000', NULL, 0),
